        "Background": "A brilliant but socially awkward inventor, Braun lived alone surrounded by half-finished gadgets, always chasing the one breakthrough that would make his mark. That breakthrough turned out to be Miho, a damaged android he found discarded and repaired — who has stayed loyally by his side ever since, upending his quiet, solitary life.",
        "Personality": "Introverted and easily flustered, especially around women, Braun is nonetheless kind and honest to a fault — a terrible liar who wears his feelings openly. He can be absent-minded, and is an easy target for bullies."
