      "fields": {
        "Background": "Braun: Attacks\nFirst Day of Sale Shove!: When a new Draconic Quest game is out, Braun can hold his place in line. Sometimes.\n\nBraun: Inventions\nBraun constantly scraps and rebuilds his inventions, but a few see regular use: a laptop with built-in hacking aids, and a pair of ordinary-looking glasses with several extrasensory functions, both kept handy via his Dimensional Pocket.\n\nBraun: Connections & Cosplay\nBraun occasionally trades in black-market parts he can't get otherwise, and sews and sells cosplay costumes for extra cash — including most of Miho's own wardrobe."
      }
